    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_60_se",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.SE.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "x , 1 6). Qni ergo contemnit Apostolos, contemnit Christum : qni con­ temnit patres contemnit Christum qni in patribus est.",
