    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_60_se",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.SE.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sim­ pliciter dico vobis : Omnia peccata odio habet Deus , mendacium, perjurium, furtum, latrocinium, adulte­ rium ,",
